dding them properly gives 892710, which matches the distributive method result. So both methods confirm that the product is 892710.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is 892710.\n\nBut just to be absolutely sure, let me compute 910 x 981 using another approach. Maybe using the difference of squares or something else. Wait, 981 is 1000 - 19. So 910 x (1000 - 19) = 910 x 1000 - 910 x 19.\n\nCompute 910 x 1000 = 910,000.\n\nCompute 910 x 19. Let's break that down: 910 x 10 = 9100, 910 x 9 = 8190. So 9100 + 8190 = 17,290.\n\nTherefore, 910,000 - 17,290 = 892,710. Yep, same result. So that's another confirmation.\n\nAlternatively, using the standard multiplication:\n\n910\n\nx981\n\n--------\n\nFirst, multiply 910 by 1: 910\n\nMultiply 910 by 8: 7280 (shifted left by 1: 72800)\n\nMultiply 910 by 9: 8190 (shifted left by 2: 819000)\n\nAdd them:\n\n910\n\n72800\n\n819000\n\n= 892710\n\nYes, that's correct. So all methods lead to 892710. Therefore, the product of 910 and 981 is 892710.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 910 and 981 is \\boxed{892710}.\n"] 19%|█▉        | 96/500 [1:38:16<4:46:11, 42.50s/it]
