\xa0\xa02565\xa0\xa0(855 × 3)\n\xa0\xa068400\xa0\xa0(855 × 80)\n\xa0\xa0342000\xa0\xa0(855 × 400)\n--------\n\xa0\xa0412965\n\nYes, adding those gives 412,965. \n\nTherefore, the product of 855 and 483 is 412,965. \n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 855 and 483 is \\boxed{412965}.\n"] 24%|██▎       | 118/500 [1:58:45<6:49:14, 64.28s/it]
