lace): \\(3384\\), shifted two positions left: \\(338400\\)\n   - Add all parts: \\(22560 + 225600 + 338400 = 586560\\) (incorrect result due to miscalculation in shifting places)\n\n4. **Correct application of the distributive property:**\n   - The distributive method is accurate, yielding the correct result of **363,216**.\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 376 and 966 is \\boxed{363216}.",
