erefore, adding them properly gives 90,972, which matches the other method.\n\nSo, the correct product of 532 and 171 is 90,972.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 532 and 171 is \\boxed{90972}.\n"] 64%|██████▎   | 318/500 [5:03:07<1:47:00, 35.28s/it]
